{"text": "CAMP KESTREL RIDGE -- 2026 REGISTRATION CONFIRMATION\noperated by Kestrel Ridge Outdoor Education, Inc.  |  4410 Fish Creek Road, Estes Park, CO 80517\nConfirmation KR26-004417        Family ID F-22871        Registered 02/14/2026\n\nPARENT/GUARDIAN\n  Beatriz Zamora  (Mom)      cell 970-555-0148   work 970-555-0102 x318   bea.zamora@mailbox.example\n  Colm Cavanaugh  (Dad)      cell (303) 555-0175                          colm.cavanaugh@mailbox.example\n  Household: 1418 Remington Street, Fort Collins, CO 80524. Dad's address: 2200 Blake St., Unit 507, Denver 80205.\n  Custody: parents share custody, week on / week off. Either parent may pick up. See pickup list.\n\nCAMPER 1   Mateo Zamora-Cavanaugh   born 07/30/2014 (11)   Grade 6 in the fall   Cabin: Owls   T-shirt YM\n  Session 2: June 21 - July 3, 2026   Swim level 4   Returning camper (camper no. C-10338)\n  Allergies: peanut and tree nut - anaphylaxis. Carries EpiPen Jr; second pen to the nurse at check-in.\n  Medications: methylphenidate ER 27 mg every morning (ADHD); Rx no. RX 4417-22906. Parent note: \"Teo will say he\n  already took it. He didn't.\"\n\nCAMPER 2   Ines Zamora-Cavanaugh   born 11/02/2017 (8)   Grade 3 in the fall   Cabin: Marmots   T-shirt YS\n  Session 2 (same dates)   Swim level 2   First year\n  Allergies: none known. Dietary: vegetarian. Wears a hearing aid in her right ear (serial HA-R-7Q20418) - remove for\n  swimming, case goes to the cabin counselor. Bedwetting, occasional - mom has packed supplies; please be discreet.\n  Ines and Mateo may NOT share canteen money; $40 each on account.\n\nINSURANCE / PHYSICIAN\n  Wickford Health Cooperative, subscriber Beatriz Zamora, member ID WHC-770418-2206, group 88140\n  Dr. Laleh Farouk, Poudre Canyon Pediatrics, 970.555.0119. Physical on file dated 1/22/26 (Form CR-7).\n\nPICKUP LIST (photo ID required)\n  Person                       Relationship            Vehicle / plate\n  Beatriz Zamora               mother                  blue Subaru Outback, CO CQT-418\n  Colm Cavanaugh               father                  Honda Odyssey, CO BRN-J72\n  Rosario Zamora               grandmother             same Subaru; her cell 970 555 0163\n  Stephen Dvorak (\"Skip\")       neighbor                gray pickup, plate 481-XPL\n  NOT authorized: Colm's girlfriend, per Ms. Zamora. Call mom first if anyone else shows up.\n\nPAYMENT\n  Tuition, Session 2 x 2 campers      $2,360.00     ($1,180 each)\n  Sibling discount                      -$118.00\n  Deposit paid 2/14                    -$400.00     American Express ending 73767\n  Remaining balance                    $1,842.00     auto-charge on May 1, 2026\n  Card on file: Amex 3417 944421 73767, exp 05/28, CID 8823, name on card BEATRIZ M ZAMORA,\n  billing ZIP 80524. Mr. Cavanaugh reimburses half directly; do not split the charge.\n\nPORTAL\n  https://families.kestrelridge.example/login     username bzamora84     temporary password Kestrel-7Owls (change at first sign-in)\n  Upload the signed waiver (C.R.S. § 13-22-107) and photo release by April 15.\n\nCheck-in is Sunday 1:00-3:00 at the lodge. Bring the medication in its original pharmacy bottle.\nWe are accredited by the American Camp Association.\n\nGreta Esposito, Registrar   registrar@kestrelridge.example   970-555-0190\nThank you, Bea!", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "425 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Beatriz Zamora", "Colm Cavanaugh", "Mateo Zamora-Cavanaugh", "Ines Zamora-Cavanaugh", "Rosario Zamora", "Stephen Dvorak", "Skip", "BEATRIZ M ZAMORA", "Greta Esposito"], "companies": ["Kestrel Ridge Outdoor Education, Inc.", "Wickford Health Cooperative", "Poudre Canyon Pediatrics", "American Express", "American Camp Association", "Kestrelridge"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Estes Park", "Fort Collins", "Denver", "lodge"], "health": ["peanut allergy", "tree nut allergy", "anaphylaxis", "methylphenidate ER", "ADHD", "hearing aid", "bedwetting", "vegetarian"], "sensitive": ["race or ethnicity", 